# Optional — NOT required for a standard Battle.net Steam shortcut.
# To use: copy to /usr/local/etc/wow-forever.env on the guest (Launch-BattleNet.sh loads it if present).
#
# === Configure in DroidDeck / Steam ===
#   Target: Battle.net Launcher.exe
#   Compatibility: DroidDeck-Proton 11-9.1 ARM64EC WoW (see repo README — Proton releases)
#   Launch options: /usr/local/bin/Launch-BattleNet.sh %command%
#   Session: Linux Vulkan driver
#
# Battle.net → WoW → Game Settings → Additional command line arguments: -d3d11
#
# Launch-BattleNet.sh starts droiddeck-steamgame-stamp.sh, then Proton.
#
# === Typical path overrides ===
# WOW_ROOT=/root/Storage/Game
# BNET_DIR=/root/Storage/Battle.net
#
# === FEX (only if Battle.net fails without them; Proton sets FEX on aarch64 by default) ===
# FEX_APP_DATA_LOCATION=/run/droiddeck/fex-4153382437/
# FEX_BNET_FORCE_X86=1
# FEX_DYNAMICL1CACHE=0
#
# WOW_LOGDIR=/tmp/wow-launch
